            "sid": "ROM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Brethren, my heart's desire and prayer to God for them is that they may be saved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I bear them witness that they have a zeal for God, but it is not enlightened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 1.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For, being ignorant of the righteousness that comes from God, and seeking to establish their own, they did not submit to God's righteousness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.7.1+ROM.7.2+ROM.7.3+ROM.7.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "7.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For Christ is the end of the law, that every one who has faith may be justified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
