            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 7.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Moses writes that the man who practices the righteousness which is based on the law shall live by it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.12+DEU.30.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 30.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But the righteousness based on faith says, Do not say in your heart, “Who will ascend into heaven?” (that is, to bring Christ down) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or “Who will descend into the abyss?” (that is, to bring Christ up from the dead). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.30.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 30.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But what does it say? The word is near you, on your lips and in your heart (that is, the word of faith which we preach); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 10.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 12.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 16.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because, if you confess with your lips that Jesus is Lord and believe in your heart that God raised him from the dead, you will be saved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For man believes with his heart and so is justified, and he confesses with his lips and so is saved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 28.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 9.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The scripture says, “No one who believes in him will be put to shame.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 3.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.3.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GAL.3.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gal 3.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Col 3.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.10.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 10.36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For there is no distinction between Jew and Greek; the same Lord is Lord of all and bestows his riches upon all who call upon him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joel 2.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 2.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For, “every one who calls upon the name of the Lord will be saved.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But how are men to call upon him in whom they have not believed? And how are they to believe in him of whom they have never heard? And how are they to hear without a preacher? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 52.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And how can men preach unless they are sent? As it is written, “How beautiful are the feet of those who preach good news!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.53.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 53.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 12.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " But they have not all obeyed the gospel; for Isaiah says, “Lord, who has believed what he has heard from us?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So faith comes from what is heard, and what is heard comes by the preaching of Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
